---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../../../components/CTABand.astro';
import StructuredData from '../../../components/StructuredData.astro';

const articleData = {
  headline: 'Your Guide to Porcelain Veneers in Minnetonka, MN',
  description:
    'How porcelain veneers work, what to expect from the process, and how to care for your new smile — from Center for Smile Enhancement in Minnetonka, MN.',
  datePublished: '2025-11-17',
  author: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Center for Smile Enhancement',
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Your Guide to Porcelain Veneers in Minnetonka, MN"
  description="Considering porcelain veneers in Minnetonka, MN? Learn how the process works, what results to expect, and how to keep your new smile looking its best."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="Cosmetic Dentistry"
      title="Your Guide to Porcelain Veneers in Minnetonka, MN"
      breadcrumbs={[
        { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
        { label: 'Blog', href: '/blog/' },
        { label: 'Guide to Porcelain Veneers' },
      ]}
    />

    <section aria-label="Article content" class="section-white">
      <div class="site-container section-py">
        <div class="article-prose">
          <p>If you’ve ever wished for a brighter, straighter, or more even smile, porcelain veneers could be your perfect solution. At <strong>The Center for Smile Enhancement in Minnetonka</strong>, Dr. Michael Sudit and Dr. Whitney Davidson specialize in creating natural-looking veneers that blend seamlessly with your teeth—enhancing both confidence and appearance.</p>

          <h2>What Are Porcelain Veneers?</h2>

          <p>Porcelain veneers are thin, custom-made shells that cover the front surface of your teeth. They correct imperfections like discoloration, chips, gaps, and minor misalignment. The result? A radiant, natural-looking smile that can last for over a decade with proper care.</p>

          <h2>The Veneer Procedure: What to Expect</h2>

          <ol><li><p><strong>Consultation:</strong> Dr. Sudit and Dr. Davidson evaluate your smile, discuss your goals, perform scanning and imaging, and show computer-generated results.</p></li><li><p><strong>Preparation:</strong> A small amount of enamel is gently reshaped to ensure a precise fit.</p></li><li><p><strong>Impressions:</strong> Custom molds are sent to our dental lab for veneer fabrication.</p></li><li><p><strong>Placement:</strong> Once ready, the veneers are bonded securely for a flawless result.</p></li></ol>

          <h2>Benefits of Porcelain Veneers</h2>

          <ul><li><p>Instantly whiter, more symmetrical smile</p></li><li><p>Durable and stain-resistant</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive and long-lasting</p></li><li><p>Boosts self-confidence and oral aesthetics</p></li></ul>

          <h2>Caring for Your Veneers</h2>

          <p>Maintain regular brushing and flossing, use a non-abrasive toothpaste, and schedule professional cleanings twice a year. Avoid biting on hard objects to preserve their longevity.</p>

          <h2>FAQs</h2>

          <p><strong>1. How long do porcelain veneers last?</strong> Typically 10–15 years with proper care and maintenance.</p>

          <p><strong>2. Do veneers look natural?</strong> Yes—Dr. Sudit and Dr. Davidson custom-shade each veneer to match your surrounding teeth.</p>

          <p><strong>3. Is the procedure painful?</strong> No, it’s minimally invasive and performed under local anesthesia for comfort.</p>

          <p><strong>4. Can veneers fix crooked teeth?</strong> They can correct mild misalignment; severe cases may need orthodontic treatment first.</p>

          <p><strong>5. How do I know if I’m a candidate for veneers?</strong> Schedule a consultation with Dr. Sudit and Dr. Davidson to discuss your smile goals and dental health.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CTABand
      heading="Ready to Transform Your Smile?"
      sub="Schedule a complimentary cosmetic consultation to see if porcelain veneers are right for you."
    />
  </main>

  <Footer />

  <StructuredData type="Article" data={articleData} />
</BaseLayout>
